  "_notes": [
    "Paper × Midnight tokens v1.6: softer layered shadows (Midnight-tinted, negative spread) and new shadow-lg. v1.5: Increase Contrast and Reduce Transparency overrides (CSS only; no value changes). v1.4: Instrument Sans primary (Geist Mono secondary), loosened heading tracking, 90% display width. v1.3: usage notes only. v1.2: secondary-button border, x-small controls, compact pointer sizes with touch overrides, hover shadows. v1.1: audit fixes A1–A5, missing semantic tokens, T1–T5 and S1–S4 applied. Optional O1–O3 were not applied.",
    "Component-driven additions: background.inverse, text.inverse, overlay.backdrop (tooltip and lightbox).",
    "Font sizes are rem (16px base); line heights are unitless. $extensions.designPx keeps the original px values.",
    "Provisional: not proof of WCAG conformance. Test the rendered build.",
    "Colour alone never communicates meaning: links are underlined, selection has an indicator, and status has an icon and a word."
